|---|---|---|---|
| A1 | Post (business_id,status,created_at) [Sec.9 literal] | MISSING | - |
| A2 | Reel (business_id,status,created_at) [Sec.9 literal] | MISSING | - |
| A3 | Story (business_id,status,created_at) [Sec.9 literal] | MISSING | - |
| A4 | Story (business_id,status,expires_at) [as built, P-046] | FOUND-EXACT | story_biz_status_exp_idx |
| B1 | BusinessProfile (category_id,city) [Sec.9 literal] | MISSING | - |
